---
description: Domain rules for spaces, entries, transfers, and privacy
alwaysApply: true
---

# Domain invariants

- Members edit **only their own** entries.
- Shared flag = aggregation/visibility, **not** settlement.
- Transfers between members are a distinct type (`transfer_out` / `transfer_in`): reduce the sender’s leftover like personal spend, increase the receiver’s like income, and **do not** count as space spend.
- Credit-card statement detail is optional on expenses whose **category** has line detail enabled (default seed: Cartão de Crédito; toggleable per category). Log the statement total first; break down lines later from the entry card. Parent amount hits leftover once; subitems allocate categories/50-40-10; auto **Outros** = total − sum of lines (not stored).
- Card-line **parcelas** (optional): materialize future Cartão expenses with subitems `2/N`… . No future statement → create expense (total = parcel, `cardInstallmentSeeded`); exists + seeded → add line and sync total to sum of lines; exists + manual → add line and **bump** statement total by the parcel (Outros stays — the parcel is new bank spend). Adding a normal (non-installment) line on a manual statement still only shrinks Outros. Editing amount/description on a seeded entry clears the seeded flag.
- Card-line **recorrente** (optional, XOR with parcelas): open-ended subscription on the statement (`recurringGroupId`). First month gets the line now; later months get the same line via `ensureThrough` (same hook as entry recurring). Remove asks scope — `one` deletes only this month (skip so ensureThrough won’t recreate); `forward` deletes this line and **later months only** (same-month duplicates of the same group are not removed together). ensureThrough dedupes one line per group per month. Another identical-looking subscription is a **different** group — only the clicked line’s group is affected.
- Card-line **edit**: description/amount/category. One-off lines update in place. Installment/recurring ask scope — `one` updates only this occurrence and **detaches** it from the series (past + later untouched); `forward` updates this and later months (never past).
- Card-line **delete** (installment): same one/forward scope as edit; never rewrites or deletes past months.
- Personal leftover **carries** by default; reserve grows via **saving entries** (and opening seeds); withdraw returns to leftover as a **`reserve_withdraw` entry** (income-like on Me; created from the Reserve tab).
- Space privacy default = personal private + shared/aggregates; transparent mode is opt-in.
- Multi-owner: last owner leaving with members left → auto-transfer ownership; empty space → delete.
- One currency per space.
- Installments ≠ recurring bills — model separately. (Card-line parcelas seed future **statement expenses**, not installment-plan entries.)
- Optional features (limits, 50/40/10, close month) must be toggleable without breaking core ledgers.
